Package: MusPerSDT
Type: Package
Title: Adaptive 2AFC Signal Detection Testing for Music Signals
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person(given = "CLesimple", family = "", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "you@example.com")
Description: Tools for running adaptive two-alternative forced-choice (2AFC)
    signal detection tests to estimate detection thresholds for soft music
    signals in within-subject, hearing-impaired listener studies. Provides two
    interchangeable adaptive engines behind a common interface: a Levitt (1971)
    transformed up-down staircase (2-down/1-up, 70.7% target) and a Bayesian
    QUEST+/Psi engine (Watson & Pelli, 1983; Kontsevich & Tyler, 1999). Includes
    helpers for interleaving multiple adaptive tracks (listener x condition x
    signal) and a simulated observer for testing.
